“Your word is a lamp unto my feet, and a light unto my path” Psalms 119:105
What a night Saturday was. I live for these moments under those bright lights. I am so blessed to have CSW in my life. Meeting coach Ben, Erik and all the guys on my team has changed me forever and I am forever grateful that God led me to this gym. I’ve grown so much as a martial artist and as a man since the day I stepped into that gym and I’ve never looked back. Going to keep working hard staying humble and grinding until all these dreams come true. Crazy to see how far we’ve come and I haven’t even started yet. Nice to celebrate the win and my birthday but jobs not finished, we are hungry and still have our eyes set on that California State Title. Huge thank you to all my coaches that have brought me this far ! Special thank you to coach @thebadgerjones for all the time and hours of work he puts into us. I swear one day he’s gonna get it all back. Can’t wait to see what the future holds #strapseason 
