Some stills from behind the scenes of our lens test of the Mamiya 645C rehoused lenses, done by GL optics. 

These lenses continue to amaze me as I work with them more and more. Their ability to take on so many shapes with characteristics within just simple F stop adjustments is astounding to me. The range they express as well is simply stunning. 

Creamy skin tones with soft fall off and beautiful contrast while still having the ability to be tack sharpe as well as delicate in their ability for close focus (all lenses within 16”) just stand out so much to me. 

First 5 photos are BTS. Shot on @leica M7 with @cinestillfilm 800 last 5 are some shots from the test. Shot with the @arri Alex LF 

Model: @samjkerns 

DPs: @katearizmendi 
@gezess 
@lorenzopacedop 
@emmapenrose 
@agustinabiasutto 
@_shannonpalmer 

I can’t wait to see what else these lenses are capable of as time goes on. 

