Vanity room and powder room...

If you're looking for me, I'll be at home in these bathrooms forever. 

For those wondering, our laundry was re-located to the garage to allow room for these incredible bathrooms.

@bearcanvas_interiors gave us a wonderful layout that was an excellent starting point.

Tommy from @the.build.studio has been a legend and it felt good to have someone on our team.

@azlanjuniorbhatti had a secret talent...venetian plaster...and it saved us at the eleventh hour when we ran out of tiles..so this vanity wall is his wonderful handy work.

@paintperfectionau my favourite tradie (and husband) was commander and chief, and delivered 1000% 🙌. 

Tapware and basins from @abiinteriors, tiles from @urbantileco. Lights @beaconlighting. @handlehouseandthings with the travertine half moon. @activeelect with the lighting. Custom cabinity by Al and his team. Tiles by @tile_stone_projects. @giorgiograesanaustralia was the Venetian supplier 

