The question is, how many times can I photograph the one area.......answer would be, as many rocks as I can balance on, a different photo can be taken, so hundreds of times😂

My heart strings have been pulling me back home to my birth place now for many years, and every trip back home makes it harder and harder to go back to a concrete city, so the decision has been made, time to come back!! 

East Coast has so much to offer for photographers and nature lovers, it really is hard to take a bad photo here!!

Now, time to find a job on the East Coast....any takers? 😍

