When the lines align 💥

Yep, I saw this beauty 'The Jackson' coming from a distance and thought, wow, this is huge, then I saw the amazing elegant lines and size of it as it approached, it certainly is eye catching.

It just so happened that I took a photo at the exact right moment when the lines of The Jackson & Opera House met. I was tickled pink, to say the least. It was a match, for sure!

Though the weather was average, this sight was far from average.

