18 chapters of our weekend in the snow:

1. Friends travel seven hours to see (eat) snow;
2. Pregnant lady is tired of falling through the snow so crawling becomes the transport method of choice;
3. Friends stumble across a snowman in the wild;
4. Husband takes pity on his marshmallow wife and takes her for a ride;
5. Pink scarf is the main event;
6. Snowman nearly loses his nose;
7. Six friends link up three toboggans and attempt to slide down the hill; it doesn’t work;
8. Pregnant lady or puffy jacket?;
9. Lady feeling proud that she can still squat low enough to pee in the snow;
10. Whimsical leaps over icy streams;
11. Two thumbs up from the longest legs you’ve seen;
12. Coupl’a cuties at sunset;
13. The trees look scary. And magical;
14. Toboggans bringing on the grins;
15. Pregnant lady digs hole in the snow to remember what lying on her stomach is like;
16. Couple more cuties about to tear down the slopes;
17. The nightmare car park looking less nightmarish;
18. Soon-to-be-parents enjoying their last kid-free holiday for a while.

